  "body": "CCC & title issued, move in ready!\r\nWelcome to a boutique development where thoughtful design, exceptional workmanship and attention to detail come together to create something genuinely special.\r\n\r\nFrom the stylish exterior to the beautifully considered interiors, these brand-new homes are anything but ordinary. Each residence has its own personality, with distinctive layouts, sophisticated colour blocking and beautifully balanced neutral tones creating a contemporary yet timeless feel.\r\n\r\nThe attention to detail is something you can see and feel. From the designer kitchens and high-end appliances to the carefully selected tiles, benchtops, hardware, lighting and joinery, quality materials have been used throughout.\r\n\r\nInside, the homes offer generous open-plan kitchen and living spaces, designed for modern everyday living and entertaining, with excellent indoor-outdoor flow extending naturally to the outdoors.\r\n\r\nComfort is taken care of year-round with a central heating and cooling system.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this project particularly appealing is the combination of style, space, quality and affordability. Whether you're a first-home buyer, downsizer, investor or upsizer, there is something here to suit a range of lifestyles and stages of life.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location.\r\n\r\nEnjoy an easy stroll to Waiake Beach, with local cafés and restaurants close by. It's a relaxed coastal lifestyle with a welcoming community right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nIn zone for:\r\n* Torbay Primary School.\r\n* Northcross Intermediate.\r\n* Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nThis is a project full of character and personality - definitely not your average new build.\r\n\r\nYou really need to see these homes for yourself to appreciate the design, space and finish.\r\n\r\nCall Lucy & Chris for a private viewing, or come along to our open home - we'd love to show you around.",
